<title>ITALY: SOCCER-INTER 0 SCHALKE 0 - HALFTIME.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INTER 0 SCHALKE 0 - HALFTIME.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Internazionale Milan of Italy and Schalke of Germany were drawing 0-0 at halftime in their UEFA Cup final second leg match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Schalke lead 1-0 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
